        "cooked": "<p>In the Temple of Zhu Long, I had giant Sky-Scraper use her power to destroy an environment card, one of the Shinobi Assassins.</p>\n<p>It’s a target, so she should do 3 projectile damage. Except, they can’t be destroyed. She did her non-target effect and did sonic damage to each target.</p>\n<p>Is this intended?</p>",
